Usage: vulnscout [global options] <command> [arguments] [options]
       vulnscout <command> --help

Global options (before or after the command):
    --dev                   Mount local src/ and vulnscout_mcp/; start, restart and serve
                            also run the frontend dev server
    -h, --help              Show help for a command, or this overview
    --version               Show the VulnScout version

Data commands (also accept --project and --variant; see '<command> --help'):
    add                     Add SBOMs and scan results, then process them
    scan                    Run vulnerability scans
    match-condition         Test stored vulnerabilities against a condition
    report                  Generate reports
    export                  Export SBOMs, custom data, assessments or context
    import                  Import custom data, assessments or context
    refresh                 Refresh stored vulnerability data, including EPSS

Maintenance commands:
    delete                  Delete scans and stale data
